{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_857.unity3d","item_key":"commands[5].text","source_sha256":"fe3347ca10e5ac9810f87cf2a7fd749ff70f9af084728240f3603b7ad2ae635e","ja":"うっうー！　『ダイヤモンドダイバー◇』のみんなで、\r\nまた一緒にお仕事できるんですね♪","zh":"呜呜——！能和『钻石潜水员◇』的大家再次一起工作了呢♪","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:18:05+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_857.unity3d","item_key":"commands[6].text","source_sha256":"08e46ad98858ec9bd8a554e64a07544fb39616b1b3af376eeb2c20ae4f483ce9","ja":"うんっ！　自分もすっごく嬉しいぞ！\nところで、今日のお仕事ってなんだか知ってる？","zh":"嗯！我也特别高兴！\n对了，你知道今天的工作是什么吗？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:18:05+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_857.unity3d","item_key":"commands[7].text","source_sha256":"d6268b0fabd8309890263ee68619501ead277a238232cdf9c0852cee18fef87a","ja":"それが、私も詳しくは聞いてなくて……。","zh":"这件事，我也没听得太详细……","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:18:05+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_857.unity3d","item_key":"commands[8].text","source_sha256":"129aa79a4174d356be3ff6f49e48e7a8b9ea87e67cc6e60173f50b2f2623cf29","ja":"『ダイヤモンドダイバー◇』にピッタリのお仕事だって\r\n●●●●プロデューサーさんが言ってたんだけど……。","zh":"●●●●制作人说，这是非常适合《钻石潜水员◇》的工作……","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:18:05+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_857.unity3d","item_key":"commands[9].text","source_sha256":"be2aec1a35f2644a15f7499f78c7839dda0f180cfd064f7cbc78f9a2cddb2cdf","ja":"自分達にピッタリの仕事かぁ……。\n前みたいに水族館かな？　それとも海とか？","zh":"适合我们自己的工作啊……。\n像之前那样去水族馆？还是去海边？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:18:05+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_857.unity3d","item_key":"commands[10].text","source_sha256":"222269cf86dbcf24fad611091adbc58e6c663bbd9192947d29d515369edc1ceb","ja":"それとも……元気な私達に\nピッタリってこととかかな？","zh":"还是说……是指特别适合精神饱满的我们？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:18:05+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_857.unity3d","item_key":"commands[11].text","source_sha256":"4636c5c17e44cf594c4896104cf5feb28f21d146d4dbe4363924aeb023c9bbf8","ja":"そういえば、スタッフさんが、今日は\nヘリコプターに乗って移動するって言ってました。","zh":"说起来，工作人员说今天要乘坐直升机移动。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:18:05+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_857.unity3d","item_key":"commands[12].text","source_sha256":"786372a3802caf630221944768347f21fdc4c90a2a9832e281ffe4773998c179","ja":"ヘリコプター？","zh":"直升机？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:18:05+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_857.unity3d","item_key":"commands[13].text","source_sha256":"809c73613045ff2c9cdf6406902792e2f97f0ed014d8d45c0db359e899228be2","ja":"はい。私、高いところが苦手だから、\n乗ってる間はずっと目をつぶってるかも……。","zh":"好的。我不太擅长待在高处，\n乘坐期间可能会一直闭着眼睛……","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:18:05+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_857.unity3d","item_key":"commands[14].text","source_sha256":"d26b7eb5b59ce6f771a2be1252d8ead8a4ab5cfb3ecb821131a28bcd5874a7c8","ja":"う～ん……。ますますどんな仕事か、\nわからなくなってきたぞ～！？","zh":"嗯～……越来越搞不懂到底是什么工作了～！？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:18:05+00:00"}
